From adfb3cdbcea5239640122c3ef2fcdd82630a853b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 12:14:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Winch, bogging and recovery call-outs; F only calls help for
 the fjord or an empty tank

Adds a winch part (hand, electric, heavy), bogging in soft hollows, an on-foot mode to wade to a tree and winch yourself out, a rescue sled for drowning and empty tanks, and a generated recovery-mission system (terrain-found traps, victims, twists, cold clock, rescue rank).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AMrEGMCxvZELpdxWLxDwzR
---
 README.md     |    6 +-
 index.html    |   29 +-
 tracklayer.js | 1103 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 1070 insertions(+), 68 deletions(-)

